spend":[1,0,1,1.29],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[5,0,5,6.47],"cost_cuts":[5,2,3,6.47],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.001,"r5":0.049,"r1_spy":-0.0081,"r5_spy":0.0546}}],"quotes":[{"c":"CX 2019 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2019-04-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"We implemented price increases in January, amid a 2-year high market position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2019 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2019-04-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"Our operating EBITDA margin reached 36.1% during the quarter, a 0.8% percentage point improvement on a sequential basis, reflecting the traction of our price increases and an improvement in operating expenses, which more than offset the decline in volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2019 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2019-04-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"Regarding our cost-reduction efforts, as we commented in our CEMEX Day last month, we identify additional initiatives and now expect $230 million in savings, $170 million to be reflected this year and the remainder in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2019 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2019-04-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"In addition, given favorable volume and pricing dynamics as well as $50 million in savings from our cost reduction initiatives in the region, we anticipate an increasing regional EBITDA of at least 2 percentage points for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2019 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"In this context, we announced a price increase in bag cement in selected regions, effective October 15.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2019 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"Cement pricing was up 4% year-over-year reflecting the success of our January and April price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2019 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"In our Europe and EMEA regions we are pleased with the solid growth in EBITDA and expansion in margins driven by favorable pricing and our cost-reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2019 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"The combination of favorable pricing environment and cost reduction initiatives more than offset higher costs and distribution expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2019 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2019-10-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jose Antonio Gonzalez Flores","x":"Given our year-to-date performance we have lowered our guidance for consolidated volumes and now expect cement volumes to decline from 3% to 6% while our consolidated ready-mix and aggregate volumes for the year should range from flat to minus 2% compared with those in 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2020-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"Cement prices grew by 3% sequentially, reflecting the price increase implemented at the beginning of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2020-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"April price increases in several markets were postponed until summer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando A. Gonzalez","x":"Regarding our cost reduction initiatives, as I mentioned earlier, we are continuously evaluating our markets, and we will react as needed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/cemex-sab-de-cv-cx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2020-07-27","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"We have stimulus programs, fiscal programs, furloughs, and economy open, I mean, and of course, except for restaurants and theaters, but nothing that impacted directly our activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/cemex-cx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2020-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Stable sequential pricing in our three core products as COVID-19 delay implementation of April price increases in several markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/cemex-cx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2020-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Maher Al-Haffar","x":"In addition, unless the context indicates otherwise, all references to pricing initiatives, price increases or decreases refer to prices for our products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/cemex-cx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2020-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"And finally, with the help of our COVID-19 cost savings program and better-than-expected volumes, we generated $98 million of free cash flow in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/cemex-cx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2020-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Our cost savings under Operation Resilience were visible in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/27/cemex-cx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2020-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"As we think about next year, we look to recover much of the cost increases that we were not able to pass-through this year due to COVD-19 disruptions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/cemex-cx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2020-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"During the quarter, despite a successful price increase for bagged cement, our prices were flat on a sequential basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/cemex-cx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Our cost savings initiative, lower fuel, and distribution costs were also important factors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/cemex-cx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Operation resilience cost savings were an important contributor to margin improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/cemex-cx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q4","e":"cx","d":"2021-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"As you know, 2020 April price increases were disrupted by COVID-19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/cemex-cx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q4","e":"cx","d":"2021-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Maher Al-Haffar","x":"In addition, unless the context indicates otherwise, all references to pricing initiatives, price increases or decreases refer to prices for our products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/cemex-cx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q4","e":"cx","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Our Operation Resilience cost savings initiatives were an important factor in our margin performance and were largely responsible for the 1.2 percentage points improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/cemex-cx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2020 Q4","e":"cx","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Operation Resilience, cost savings, volumes and a decline in fuel cost added to margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/cemex-cx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"The sequential increase in cement prices reflects the traction of the January price increases as well as tight supply demand conditions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cemex-cx-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"In early March, we announced a second price increase in bagged cement of approximately 4% with the objective to continue recovering input cost inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cemex-cx-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"High-capacity utilization coupled with cost savings and product mix produced significant operational leverage of 45% in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cemex-cx-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Our 28% EBITDA growth was driven by higher volumes and pricing, cost savings in OPEX and logistics as well as a higher contribution from our growth investments and urbanization solutions business. -- contributed to EBITDA growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cemex-cx-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2021-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"We are increasing our guidance for 2021 cement volumes in the Dominican Republic to 14% to 16%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cemex-cx-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2021-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vanessa Quiroga","x":"So the one question that I chose to make is regarding your increased guidance for CAPEX.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/cemex-cx-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Now, I will pass it on to Lucy so she can talk the unit results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/cemex-cx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lucy Rodriguez","x":"As a first step, we have announced a second round of price increases for July and August in most markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/cemex-cx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"The improvement was largely due to volumes and cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/cemex-cx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"We continue to make progress on rationalizing the trade and expenses, largely due to the cost savings program for this last year under our operation resilience strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/cemex-cx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"In the case of the United States and Europe, this was the first time in almost 15 years that we have introduced a second round of national cement price increases in the same year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/cemex-cx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lucy Rodriguez","x":"We have already announced price increases for January for Florida and Southern California, an area which represents approximately 35% of our cement volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/cemex-cx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francisco Chavez","x":"Besides the increase in cement prices, do you have any specific strategy to offset this margin erosion, specifically, cost savings plans, or maybe can we expect the bolt-on investment to offset this margin erosion?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/cemex-cx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2021-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"So, Vanessa, we have, as you know, we have reduced our guidance for this year to $250 billion to $200 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/cemex-cx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q4","e":"cx","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"We responded quickly within the constraints of the industry pricing paradigm to pass-through cost inflation in our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/cemex-cx-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q4","e":"cx","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Our pricing strategy from 2021 got off to a strong start with our annual price increases in the first half calibrated to our expectations for input cost inflation in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/cemex-cx-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2021 Q4","e":"cx","d":"2022-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Maher Al-Haffar","x":"I mean that has actually started paying off in '21, and we're expecting it to continue to deliver in terms of cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/10/cemex-cx-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2022 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"Importantly, our January price increases saw important traction with sequential consolidated prices up between mid-single to high-single digits for all products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/cemex-cx-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2022 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lucy Rodriguez","x":"We have already announced additional price increases for the summer in all markets and we have advised customers that further price increases may be necessary.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/cemex-cx-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2022 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2022-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"We are increasing our guidance for energy in the production of cement to 35% on a per ton of cement-produced basis, assuming no further escalation in energy costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/cemex-cx-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2022 Q1","e":"cx","d":"2022-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Adrian Huerta","x":"When you gave guidance after 4Q results and you're reiterating the guidance now for EBITDA growth of mid-single digits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/cemex-cx-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2022 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fernando Gonzalez","x":"We are in the process of implementing additional price increases across our portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/29/cemex-cx-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2022 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lucy Rodriguez","x":"We have announced double-digit price increases effective July 1st.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/29/cemex-cx-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2022 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2022-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ben Theurer","x":"So we saw the step up in maintenance and you've raised the guidance on maintenance and I think you've talked about the acceleration of maintenance in the U.S. Is that's what's been driving the SG&A cost up so much in the quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/29/cemex-cx-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2026-07-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lucy Rodriguez","x":"Rising investment in the power sector to meet growing AI electricity needs should also support demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/cemex-cx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2026-07-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lucy Rodriguez","x":"So I wanted to ask about AI infrastructure opportunity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/cemex-cx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2026-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lucy Rodriguez","x":"Do you have any news on tariffs or potential new tariffs on imports from Vietnam, Turkey following the 301 investigation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/cemex-cx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2026-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jaime Dominguez","x":"Building on the low to mid-single-digit sequential price increases secured in first quarter, consolidated prices for our three core products advanced an additional 1% in second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/cemex-cx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2026-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lucy Rodriguez","x":"The reflecting successful price increases across micro markets and geographic mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/cemex-cx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2026-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jaime Dominguez","x":"Our free cash flow from operations reached a second quarter record of $651 million, up more than $400 million year-on-year after adjusting for severance and discontinued operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/cemex-cx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2026-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jaime Dominguez","x":"I am pleased with the progress we have achieved on our $400 million cost savings program with 80% of the initial target already achieved.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/cemex-cx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q2","e":"cx","d":"2026-07-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jaime Dominguez","x":"So the low single-digit increase guidance implies a 4% growth in the second semester with a negative impact of around $20 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/cemex-cx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2026-10-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Louisa Page Rodriguez","x":"In the industrial sector, demand related to the AI ecosystem including large data centers, semiconductor facilities, and manufacturing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/26/cemex-cx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2026-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Louisa Page Rodriguez","x":"We announced a mid single digit price increase in bag cement which became effective early October.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/26/cemex-cx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2026-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Louisa Page Rodriguez","x":"Across Europe, fuel surcharges and price increases covering the majority of our ready mix volumes, are helping mitigate higher diesel costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/26/cemex-cx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CX 2026 Q3","e":"cx","d":"2026-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Maher Al-Haffar","x":"Excluding severance payments and discontinued operations, our trailing 12 month free cash flow from operations c